{{ define "title" }}Privacy Policy{{ end }}
{{ define "description" }}Privacy policy for Gearberg. Information on data processing and server hosting.{{ end }}

{{ define "page" }}
<main class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl py-24">
  <hgroup class="mb-10">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 opacity-70">Last updated: June 3rd, 2026</p>
  </hgroup>

  <section class="mb-8" aria-labelledby="overview-heading">
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how data is handled when you use this website. We process as little data as possible, but technical server operation requires the temporary processing of certain information.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8" aria-labelledby="hosting-heading">
    <h2 id="hosting-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Server Hosting &amp; Data Processing</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">Our website is hosted by Hetzner Online GmbH, Industriestr. 25, 91710 Gunzenhausen, Germany (hereafter "Hetzner"). The servers are located in Germany.</p>
    <p class="mb-3">When you visit this website, Hetzner automatically collects and stores information in so-called server log files, which your browser transmits to the server. This data includes:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-3 pl-2 opacity-90">
      <li>IP address of the requesting device</li>
      <li>Date and time of access</li>
      <li>Name and URL of the retrieved file</li>
      <li>Website from which access is made (referrer URL)</li>
      <li>Browser type and version used</li>
      <li>Operating system of your device</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This data is processed on the legal basis of Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest) to ensure a secure, stable, and functional website operation. We do not combine this data with other data sources, nor do we perform any user tracking, analytics, or profiling.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8" aria-labelledby="data-heading">
    <h2 id="data-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Cookies and Tracking</h2>
    <p>This website does not use cookies, does not load tracking scripts, and does not perform any analytics.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8" aria-labelledby="rights-heading">
    <h2 id="rights-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Your Rights</h2>
    <p>As a data subject under the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict, and port your data, as well as the right to object to processing. To exercise these rights regarding the server logs, please contact us. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8" aria-labelledby="changes-heading">
    <h2 id="changes-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The updated version will be posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <h2 id="contact-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p>Tobias Gleiter / bit8bytes / <a href="mailto:gearberg@bit8bytes.com" class="link link-primary">gearberg@bit8bytes.com</a></p>
  </section>
</main>
{{ end }}
